msgid "分组标记（Group Label）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:5
#: 8ec5739eb1f44a04a38b608d9da4252c
msgid "`Group`: `Alloy` | `Class`: `GroupLabelCard`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:7
#: f32be4702087474c9dbb8e8b07546055
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:9
#: f3eb090f88264df0aaf3904bec5322ac
msgid ""
"为结构中每个原子写入 `atoms.arrays['group']` 标签（A 或 B），按 k-vector "
"层分组或分数坐标奇偶分组。这些标签供下游 `Magnetic Order`（AFM group A/B 模式）、`Random "
"Vacancy`、`Random Doping` 的 group 约束使用。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:11
#: ec0991e0f7554256835a06011e56305e
msgid "**这是一张元数据卡，不改坐标也不改元素，只写 group 标签。**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:13
#: a9cc5757bc454fad85bb51b1abebf7e1
msgid ""
"g_{k\\text{-vec}}=\\left\\lfloor "
"2(\\mathbf{s}\\cdot\\mathbf{k})\\right\\rfloor\\bmod 2,\\quad "
"g_{parity}=\\left(\\mathrm{round}(2s_x)+\\mathrm{round}(2s_y)+\\mathrm{round}(2s_z)\\right)\\bmod"
" 2"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:15
#: 46518d20bf8a45699104ae6673418aa2
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:17
#: 09f2fecbfbe84639becbd3339f149637
msgid "场景：k-vector AFM 无法匹配你的晶格，模型 AFM 能量系统性偏高"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:19
#: 0f69abf039d44fdf9c2fadf9bb611acf
msgid ""
"你在 NiO 上用 `Magnetic Order` 的 k-vector 111 模式生成了 AFM 结构。训练后模型对 AFM "
"构型的能量预测仍比 DFT 高 0.3 eV/atom——k-vector 的波节面穿过了两种不等价原子位，导致 Ni 和 O "
"都被混合分配正负号，没有形成\"一层 Ni↑、一层 Ni↓\"的清晰子晶格翻转。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:21
#: 7f1b2b53115a4921bba57ca11ab1928f
msgid ""
"**诊断思路：** k-vector 是晶体学均匀的翻转模式，适合简单 Bravais "
"晶格。但实际磁性材料常有不等价子晶格——你需要手动定义哪些原子属于 A 子晶格（正磁矩）、哪些属于 B（负磁矩）。`Group Label` "
"就是做这件事的：先在结构里写好 group 标签，下游 `Magnetic Order` 再用 group A/B 模式按标签翻转磁矩。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:23
#: 8771f0c604ce4fe8b4c80482970c191b
msgid "**输入：** 一个 NiO 超胞，Ni 和 O 交替排列在 fcc 子晶格上"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:25
#: 23a8a1321ba64e0098463de7d13ee66e
msgid "**目标：** 按 k-vec 111 分组，奇数层 = A，偶数层 = B"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:27
#: 11ab1c312946490e89a6601c5e00fb94
msgid "**参数设置：**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:28
#: 08e9396f1aed48c7bb2247fa2e296e1c
msgid "`Mode` = `k-vector layers (recommended)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:29
#: eb4663d4062b486186091035a31213a2
msgid "`Kvec` = `111`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:30
#: 89a0b9f9ea8d4c859aa9ca2569086c50
msgid "`Group A` = `A`，`Group B` = `B`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:31
#: 72e765d813364816a7db81c723e5b4a5
msgid "`Overwrite` = 勾选"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:33
#: bfa83e3cb8374c79931fbf4a05dda25f
msgid "**输出：** 结构不变，但每个原子现在有 `group` = `A` 或 `B`，带 `Grp(k111,A/B)` 标签"
msgstr ""

