#: 6b71c5b626b742feb4ac35caa41c513c
msgid "`Group Label` → `Magnetic Order`：AFM 的 group A/B 模式需要 group 标签"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/group-label-card.md:131
#: ad0e1f0fb5fa4a43aedc8b7b643e69d3
